# Delivery With A Deadline

The supplier (${variables.supplier}) delivers to the buyer (${variables.buyer}) before the due date, ${variables.dueDate} (seconds since 1970-01-01 UTC).

If nothing has been delivered when the due date arrives, the buyer may record the delivery as late.

- Delivery note: ${variables.deliveryNote}
- Late delivery note: ${variables.lateNote}
